# NOTICE — Third-party attribution

This repository contains trained weights of the model **openSMILE + XGBoost
(Russian audio emotion classification)**. The model was trained from scratch on
hand-crafted audio functionals extracted by OpenSMILE.

## Pretrained / external components

| Component | Source | License | Relation |
|---|---|---|---|
| OpenSMILE (eGeMAPSv02 Functionals extractor) | <https://audeering.github.io/opensmile/> | research licenses (free for research; see edeering terms) | Feature extractor at training/inference time; not embedded in the weights |
| XGBoost library | <https://github.com/dmlc/xgboost> | Apache-2.0 | ML library used to train/load the model |

## Training data

| Dataset | Source | License | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Dusha (Salute Developers / Sber) | <https://github.com/salute-developers/golos/tree/master/dusha> · arXiv:2212.12266 | Dusha/Golos, attribution + share-alike (a reworked CC BY-SA 4.0) | Corpus `dusha_resd` = Dusha + RESD |
| RESD (`Aniemore/resd_annotated`) | <https://huggingface.co/datasets/Aniemore/resd_annotated> · DOI 10.57967/hf/1272 | MIT | Only the 4 target emotions are retained |

Distributing these weights does not release the user from the Dusha/Golos license
